{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02118",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 5.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.77,
      "end_seconds": 11.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.19,
      "end_seconds": 19.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.12,
      "end_seconds": 25.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.81,
      "end_seconds": 32.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Um, uh, so... not listening at school. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.03,
      "end_seconds": 37.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.15,
      "end_seconds": 45.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "It's been two days, I'm fairly sure. I've also had not hearing very well, for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.08,
      "end_seconds": 49.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "How about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.5,
      "end_seconds": 51.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "No, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.36,
      "end_seconds": 57.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Have you had any ear pain, dizziness or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.74,
      "end_seconds": 65.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Right, I haven't had ear pain, dizziness or discharge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.88,
      "end_seconds": 69.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Understood. Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.72,
      "end_seconds": 72.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.8,
      "end_seconds": 75.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.85,
      "end_seconds": 80.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.46,
      "end_seconds": 86.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.21,
      "end_seconds": 98.32,
      "duration_seconds": 10.11,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.98,
      "end_seconds": 103.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.61,
      "end_seconds": 106.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I've had anxiety, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.08,
      "end_seconds": 108.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.59,
      "end_seconds": 112.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.19,
      "end_seconds": 117.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Yes. What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.72,
      "end_seconds": 122.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "It's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.02,
      "end_seconds": 125.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.13,
      "end_seconds": 129.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "For about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.92,
      "end_seconds": 145.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.5,
      "end_seconds": 150.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Yes, cat fur. I get wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.34,
      "end_seconds": 172.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.6,
      "end_seconds": 179.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Yes, I had a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.59,
      "end_seconds": 183.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.51,
      "end_seconds": 186.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.11,
      "end_seconds": 204.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "So, I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.5,
      "end_seconds": 219.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.85,
      "end_seconds": 238.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, pulse 66, pressure 122 over 72, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.09,
      "end_seconds": 242.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.2,
      "end_seconds": 246.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.84,
      "end_seconds": 261.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Both ear drums look dull and retracted with fluid behind them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.69,
      "end_seconds": 283.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.99,
      "text": "Alright, that's the examination finished. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with glue ear. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Another possibility is wax."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.54,
      "end_seconds": 287.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.29,
      "end_seconds": 312.38,
      "duration_seconds": 23.09,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now glue ear is my leading thought, not anything worse. A hearing test is what I'd like next, for reduced hearing. We will watch for three months, and sit him at the front of the class. We'll refer you to the ENT clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.29,
      "end_seconds": 314.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.69,
      "end_seconds": 329.85,
      "duration_seconds": 13.16,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Please come and see me in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.91,
      "end_seconds": 334.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Well, okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.97,
      "end_seconds": 339.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.73,
      "end_seconds": 343.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}